 "Сколькими способами он может это сделать? Приведи все возможности.": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 242\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:400px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"140\" y=\"16\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a2230\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"92\" y=\"64\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"116.0\" y=\"95.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">1</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"64\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a2230\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"188\" y=\"64\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a2230\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"92\" y=\"112\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a2230\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"112\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a2230\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"188\" y=\"112\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"212.0\" y=\"143.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">2</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"160\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a2230\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"94\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\">→ сумма 12</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"142\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\">→ сумма 15</text><text x=\"164.0\" y=\"230\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">↓ сумма 24</text></svg><figcaption>Доска из условия. В шесть пустых клеток ставятся шесть разных цифр из 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9 — одна цифра остаётся лишней. Вписанные 1 и 2 входят в суммы своих строк.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Заметь главное. Строки и столбец пересекаются только в двух клетках": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 480 220\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:480px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"140\" y=\"16\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#16263a\" stroke=\"var(--blue)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"164.0\" y=\"47.0\" fill=\"var(--blue)\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"600\">a</text><rect x=\"92\" y=\"64\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"116.0\" y=\"95.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">1</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"64\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#3a2f18\" stroke=\"var(--gold)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"164.0\" y=\"95.0\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"600\">b</text><rect x=\"188\" y=\"64\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a2230\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"212.0\" y=\"95.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"400\">x</text><rect x=\"92\" y=\"112\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a2230\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"116.0\" y=\"143.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"400\">y</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"112\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#3a2f18\" stroke=\"var(--gold)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"164.0\" y=\"143.0\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"600\">c</text><rect x=\"188\" y=\"112\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"212.0\" y=\"143.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">2</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"160\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#16263a\" stroke=\"var(--blue)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"164.0\" y=\"191.0\" fill=\"var(--blue)\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text><path d=\"M132,40.0 C40,40.0 40,184.0 132,184.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--blue)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><polygon points=\"132,40.0 122,34.0 122,46.0\" fill=\"var(--blue)\"/><polygon points=\"132,184.0 122,178.0 122,190.0\" fill=\"var(--blue)\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"94\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\">b + x = 11</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"142\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\">y + c = 13</text><text x=\"202\" y=\"46\" fill=\"var(--blue)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\">a + d = 24 − b − c</text><text x=\"202\" y=\"190\" fill=\"var(--blue)\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\">a ↔ d: суммы не меняются</text></svg><figcaption>Строки и столбец делят только золотые клетки b и c — через них строки и влияют на столбец. Синие a и d ни в одну строку не входят: столбцу важна лишь их сумма, поэтому их можно поменять местами.</figcaption></figure>",
 "остаются четыре мира: {3, 8} и {4, 9}": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 240\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><text x=\"315.0\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#93a1b1\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">строка с 2: y + c = 13</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"46\" fill=\"#93a1b1\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">строка с 1:</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#93a1b1\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">b + x = 11</text><text x=\"205.0\" y=\"48\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{4, 9}</text><text x=\"315.0\" y=\"48\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{5, 8}</text><text x=\"425.0\" y=\"48\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{6, 7}</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"87.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"end\">{3, 8}</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"58\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"205.0\" y=\"89.0\" fill=\"#f0a83c\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><rect x=\"260\" y=\"58\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a1416\" stroke=\"#243040\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"315.0\" y=\"87.0\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">общая 8</text><rect x=\"370\" y=\"58\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"425.0\" y=\"89.0\" fill=\"#f0a83c\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"135.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"end\">{4, 7}</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"106\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a1416\" stroke=\"#243040\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"205.0\" y=\"135.0\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">общая 4</text><rect x=\"260\" y=\"106\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"315.0\" y=\"137.0\" fill=\"#f0a83c\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><rect x=\"370\" y=\"106\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a1416\" stroke=\"#243040\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"425.0\" y=\"135.0\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">общая 7</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"183.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"end\">{5, 6}</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"154\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"205.0\" y=\"185.0\" fill=\"#f0a83c\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><rect x=\"260\" y=\"154\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a1416\" stroke=\"#243040\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"315.0\" y=\"183.0\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">общая 5</text><rect x=\"370\" y=\"154\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#1a1416\" stroke=\"#243040\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"425.0\" y=\"183.0\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">общая 6</text><text x=\"315.0\" y=\"234\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(2 + 2 + 4 + 2) · 2 = 20</text></svg><figcaption>Строки таблицы — пары для строки с 1, столбцы — пары для строки с 2. <b style=\"color:#f2686c\">Красная</b> клетка: у пар общая цифра, а цифры не повторяются. В <b style=\"color:#5fd38d\">зелёной</b> клетке — мир, <b style=\"color:#f0a83c\">золотое</b> число — годные раскладки строк в нём; множитель 2 — обмен верха и низа столбца.</figcaption></figure>",
 "один мир — на картинке": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 220\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"76\" y=\"40\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#241416\" stroke=\"#f2686c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"89.0\" y=\"58.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"63.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><rect x=\"76\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3a2f18\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"89.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><rect x=\"102\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"115.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"63.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text><rect x=\"76\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3a2f18\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"89.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><rect x=\"102\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"115.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><rect x=\"76\" y=\"118\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#241416\" stroke=\"#f2686c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"89.0\" y=\"136.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><text x=\"89\" y=\"166\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a + d = 17</text><text x=\"89\" y=\"186\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">нет пары ✗</text><rect x=\"222\" y=\"40\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"235.0\" y=\"58.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><rect x=\"196\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"209.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><rect x=\"222\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3a2f18\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"235.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><rect x=\"248\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"261.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><rect x=\"196\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"209.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><rect x=\"222\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3a2f18\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"235.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text><rect x=\"248\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"261.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><rect x=\"222\" y=\"118\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"235.0\" y=\"136.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><text x=\"235\" y=\"166\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a + d = 12</text><text x=\"235\" y=\"186\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{5, 7} ✓</text><rect x=\"368\" y=\"40\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"381.0\" y=\"58.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><rect x=\"342\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"355.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><rect x=\"368\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3a2f18\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"381.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><rect x=\"394\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"407.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><rect x=\"342\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"355.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text><rect x=\"368\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3a2f18\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"381.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><rect x=\"394\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"407.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><rect x=\"368\" y=\"118\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"381.0\" y=\"136.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><text x=\"381\" y=\"166\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a + d = 12</text><text x=\"381\" y=\"186\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">{5, 7} ✓</text><rect x=\"514\" y=\"40\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#241416\" stroke=\"#f2686c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"527.0\" y=\"58.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><rect x=\"488\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"501.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><rect x=\"514\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3a2f18\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"527.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"66\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"553.0\" y=\"84.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><rect x=\"488\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"501.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><rect x=\"514\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3a2f18\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"527.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"92\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#2c394c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"553.0\" y=\"110.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><rect x=\"514\" y=\"118\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#241416\" stroke=\"#f2686c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"527.0\" y=\"136.0\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><text x=\"527\" y=\"166\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a + d = 7</text><text x=\"527\" y=\"186\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">нет пары ✗</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"22\" fill=\"#93a1b1\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">мир {3, 8} и {4, 9}: свободны 5, 6, 7, их пары дают 11, 12, 13</text></svg><figcaption>В центр каждой строки встаёт любая цифра её пары — четыре раскладки строк. <b style=\"color:#f0a83c\">Золотые</b> b и c задают, сколько не хватает столбцу; у трёх свободных цифр суммы пар разные, поэтому пара для верха и низа либо одна, либо её нет. Здесь годны две раскладки, и каждая даёт две доски: пара {5, 7} встаёт в столбец в двух порядках.</figcaption></figure>"
